	(text "OPA333 MODULE for a DIP-8 socket - the op-amp runs from a 5 V window floating on a 2 V node (it never sees 9 V)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 129.54 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 2.3 2.3) (thickness 0.3) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "96f46173-9e0c-4971-8229-ba1a5741cb4f"))
	(text "VM = 9 V * R2/(R1+R2) with the 78L05 ground current (about 4 mA) flowing into the node: R1 1k3 / R2 220R give VM ~ 2.0 V.  VREG = VM + 5 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 129.54 115.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "007cb502-f662-4320-9596-1194c08940f7"))
	(text "HT7550-1 (2.5 uA ground current) instead of the 78L05: R1 62k / R2 15k.  Op-amp pins 1, 5, 8 are not connected.  Plug-in side: J1 -> the pedal DIP-8 plug (see docs)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 129.54 120.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "93c4cd79-b09f-4e40-9c04-8fb9833649c3"))
	(text "J1: 1 IN+ (3)  2 IN- (2)  3 OUT (6)  4 +9V (7)  5 GND (4)   [DIP-8 pin in brackets]" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 129.54 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4c397d7b-9535-41de-a448-38e76947781b"))
	(text "VREG (VM + 5 V)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 215.22 147.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4ee5bcad-8a92-4e20-b73e-3a585980ee95"))
